  "favourites_count": 10,
  "description": "<h1>Cobra’s Ammo Stack</h1>\n<p>Take complete control over ammunition stack sizes in <strong>SPT 4.0.13</strong>.</p>\n<p>Cobra’s Ammo Stack is a lightweight server-side mod that allows you to configure ammunition stack sizes by caliber, support custom ammunition from other mods, and override individual items using a simple JSON configuration.</p>\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Configure stack sizes by caliber</li>\n<li>Support for vanilla ammunition</li>\n<li>Support for modded ammunition</li>\n<li>Custom caliber support</li>\n<li>Individual item overrides</li>\n<li>Configurable default stack size</li>\n<li>Lightweight server-side implementation</li>\n<li>No client installation required</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the latest release.</li>\n<li>Extract the ZIP file.</li>\n<li>Drag the included <strong>SPT</strong> folder into your SPT installation.</li>\n<li>Allow Windows to merge the folders.</li>\n<li>Start the SPT Server.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Configuration</h2>\n<p>Edit the included <code>config.json</code> to customize stack sizes.</p>\n<p>Supported options include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Default stack size</li>\n<li>Per-caliber stack sizes</li>\n<li>Custom calibers</li>\n<li>Individual item overrides</li>\n<li>Optional startup logging</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Compatibility</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>SPT 4.0.13</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Source Code</h2>\n<p>The complete source code is available on GitHub:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/CobraSnipper/CobrasAmmoStack\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/CobraSnipper/CobrasAmmoStack</a></p>\n<h2>License</h2>\n<p>Released under the MIT License.</p>\n",
